{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2021-05-10 08:30:00', 'title': 'ALLERGAN AESTHETICS TO ACQUIRE SOLITON, EXPANDING BODY CONTOURING PORTFOLIO', 'text': 'IRVINE, CALIF. AND HOUSTON, MAY 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ALLERGAN AESTHETICS, AN ABBVIE COMPANY (NYSE: ABBV) AND SOLITON (NASDAQ: SOLY) TODAY ANNOUNCED A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT UNDER WHICH ALLERGAN AESTHETICS WILL ACQUIRE SOLITON AND RESONICTM, ITS RAPID ACOUSTIC PULSE DEVICE WHICH RECENTLY RECEIVED U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) 510(K) CLEARANCE AND IS A NON-INVASIVE TREATMENT FOR THE SHORT-TERM IMPROVEMENT IN THE APPEARANCE OF CELLULITE.'}